# SIEM ML Predictor has no required environment variables — the trained model
# (src/models/model.json, meta.json) is loaded straight from disk and the app
# has no external services, API keys, or database to configure.
#
# Optional overrides for the dev server, if you don't want the defaults
# used in docs/setup-guide.md:
HOST=127.0.0.1
PORT=8000
